  "question": {
    "text": "In the measurement of resistance of a wire using Ohm's law, the plot between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi></math> is drawn as shown, then resistance of given wire will be<br />\r<br />\r<img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0034_706ba7597c94.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 138px;\" />"
  },
